===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*h₂ey-}}
[[syncope|Syncope]] of earlier {{m|la|aevitās}}, from {{inh|la|itc-pro|*aiwotāts}}, from {{m|itc-pro|*aiwom}} ((whence also {{m|la|aevum}}) from {{der|la|ine-pro|*h₂eyu-||lifetime}}, from {{der|la|ine-pro|*h₂ey-||vital energy, life}}) + {{m|itc-pro|*-tāts}} (whence also {{m|la|-tās}}). Surface etymology: from {{suffix|la|aevum|tās}}.

